Description:You have Abrupt Decay and Arcane Denial in hand and B G U U floating. The opponent controls Grizzly Bears. Your library has six cards. By the end of the opponent's next turn, have Grizzly Bears in the opponent's graveyard and exactly three cards drawn (three cards left in your library).
